src/withdraws/AbstractWithdrawRequestManager.sol:getWithdrawRequestValue:322|class=C15|Medium|Once EthenaCooldownHolder._startCooldown calls sUSDe.cooldownShares, the escrowed position is a fixed USDe claim in the Ethena silo, but the not-finalized branch of getWithdrawRequestValue still values it as w.yieldTokenAmount sUSDe at the live TRADING_MODULE sUSDe→asset oracle rate, so any unprivileged holder who calls initiateWithdraw sees their collateral value — the number AbstractStakingStrategy.convertToAssets feeds to the borrow/health-factor path — grow monotonically with sUSDe's exchange rate for the entire cooldown even though the underlying claim is frozen, letting them borrow against yield the position no longer earns and blocking otherwise-valid liquidation.|src/withdraws/AbstractWithdrawRequestManager.sol|<work>/notional/zone-hunt-out/verify/gates/26_src_withdraws_AbstractWithdrawRequestManager_sol_getWithdrawRequestValue_322/aux.sol
